==Overview==
The Giant Spider Astro Toilet is an enemy added in the [[Episode 76 Part 2 Update]]. It is the boss of wave 59 in Abysmal mode and appears in wave 168 [[Endless Mode]].

==Appearance==
The Giant Spider Astro Toilet is a black toilet with a red glowing evil eyed grinning face, a small goatee and black helmet. It has four spider-like robotic legs that move it in a way that is locomotion. The toilet tank has a circle on the back with spaces and electricity crackles inside the circle.

==Strategy==
[[Endless Mode]]: It is recommended to bring a high DPS unit with more than 70k DPS (eg. [[Hyper Upgraded Titan Speakerman]], [[Upgraded Titan Cinemaman]], [[Titan Fanman]],…) as this enemy has an immense amount of health and also slowing units to beat it because it has 2.276.578.560 HP.

==Trivia==

* This unit has no boss icon
* This unit is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Impactor_Astro_Toilet Impactor Astro Toilet] from the original series
* Unlike his [[Astro Spider Toilet|original]] version, he is not immune to all slowing.
